sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Engineer
  participant R as Runner
  participant C as Live context
  participant M as AI model
  participant S as Metric sources
  participant D as Database
  P->>R: Asks a question
  R->>C: Reads alerts, targets, signals, changes
  R->>D: Finds past work this person may read
  R->>D: Finds matching reviewed workflows
  loop Up to the round and token limits
    R->>D: Logs the exact prompt
    R->>M: Sends the prompt
    M-->>R: Answer, or a read-only query
    opt The model asked for a query
      R->>S: Runs it, through the outgoing guard
      S-->>R: Result, credentials removed
    end
  end
  R->>R: Checks cited numbers and queries, and lowers confidence if they fail
  R->>D: Saves answer, cost, and checks
  R-->>P: Shows the answer, private to this person
  opt The person chooses to share
    P->>D: Share with team
    Note over D: Engineers can read it.<br/>Viewers get the question and answer only.
  end
